---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Breadcrumbs from '../../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro'; import LastVerified from '../../../components/LastVerified.astro'; import UpdateBadge from '../../../components/UpdateBadge.astro'; import QuickAnswer from '../../../components/QuickAnswer.astro'; import SourceList from '../../../components/SourceList.astro'; import { sourceUrls, patch107 } from '../../../data/sources';
const title='DragonSword Awakening Runes — Capacity, Synthesis & Build Relevance'; const description='DragonSword Awakening Runes guide covering inventory capacity, ownership display, 4-Star synthesis, possible 5-Star results and what remains unverified.'; const canonical='https://dragonswordguide.com/systems/runes/'; const article={ '@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Article',headline:title,description,mainEntityOfPage:canonical,datePublished:'2026-08-08',dateModified:'2026-08-08',publisher:{'@type':'Organization',name:'DragonSword Guide'} }; const sources=[{label:'Official 1.0.7 update notes',href:sourceUrls.announcements,note:'supports capacity 200 → 500, owned-count display and 4-Star synthesis yielding 5-Star Runes.'}];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} ogType="article" schema={[article]}><div class="shell page-wrap"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'DragonSword Guide',href:'/'},{label:'Systems',href:'/systems/runes/'},{label:'Runes'}]}/><article><header class="article-header"><p class="eyebrow">Systems · Rune inventory</p><h1>DragonSword Awakening Runes</h1><LastVerified date="August 8, 2026"/></header><QuickAnswer title="The official 1.0.7 note gives us the inventory facts."><p>Rune inventory capacity increased from 200 to 500, owned Rune counts are now shown, and 4-Star Rune Synthesis can yield 5-Star Runes. Drop rates, stat ceilings and optimal farming routes are not verified here.</p></QuickAnswer><UpdateBadge label={`${patch107.label} · Rune changes`} href={patch107.href}/><div class="copy"><h2>What are Runes?</h2><p>Runes are part of the build conversation, but a trustworthy build page needs the in-game fields and values in front of us. We explain the public system changes first and leave optimization claims open.</p><h2>Rune inventory</h2><div class="metrics"><div><strong>500</strong><span>Current stated capacity</span></div><div><strong>200 → 500</strong><span>1.0.7 capacity change</span></div><div><strong>4★ → 5★</strong><span>Possible synthesis result</span></div></div><h2>Synthesis and farming</h2><p>The patch confirms the synthesis possibility. It does not establish a universal best Rune, drop rate, stat ceiling or optimal farming route, so those claims remain marked as not yet verified.</p><h2>Build relevance</h2><p>When you evaluate a build, connect Rune choices to Hero role, team order and Status/Signal flow. Avoid treating an isolated Rune screenshot or community recommendation as a complete build.</p></div><SourceList sources={sources}/></article></div></BaseLayout>
<style>.page-wrap{padding:1.25rem 0 2rem}.article-header{max-width:820px;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent-light);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}h1,h2{line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em}h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,5rem);margin:0 0 .7rem}h2{font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2rem);margin:2.5rem 0 .7rem}.copy{max-width:760px}.copy p{color:var(--muted-strong)}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.7rem}.metrics div{display:grid;gap:.2rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper);border-radius:10px}.metrics strong{color:var(--accent-light);font-size:1.3rem}.metrics span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem}@media(max-width:650px){.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
